Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\"><a href=\"/wiki/Love_in_the_Time_of_Fishing\" title=\"Love in the Time of Fishing\">Love in the Time of Fishing</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Old_Man_and_the_Whale_(Quest)\" title=\"Old Man and the Whale (Quest)\">Old Man and the Whale</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRewards\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rewards\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"card-list-container\"><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-5\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fame\" title=\"Fame\"><img alt=\"Fame\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Fame.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Fame.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e5/Item_Fame.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20250225212613\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 300</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-5\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astrite\" title=\"Astrite\"><img alt=\"Astrite\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Astrite.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Astrite.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/16/Item_Astrite.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523021541\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 20</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-5\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Universal_Compass\" title=\"Universal Compass\"><img alt=\"Universal Compass\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Universal Compass.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Universal_Compass.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/3/39/Item_Universal_Compass.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20250225214416\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 1</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-5\"><span typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Item_Fragment_of_a_Mysterious_Scripture_Chapter_One.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Item Fragment of a Mysterious Scripture Chapter One.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"74\" data-height=\"74\">Fragment of a Mysterious Scripture: Chapter One</span></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 1</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-4\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advanced_Sealed_Tube\" title=\"Advanced Sealed Tube\"><img alt=\"Advanced Sealed Tube\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Advanced Sealed Tube.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Advanced_Sealed_Tube.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d6/Item_Advanced_Sealed_Tube.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240529094344\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 3</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Riccioli_Fishery_Coin\" title=\"Riccioli Fishery Coin\"><img alt=\"Riccioli Fishery Coin\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Riccioli Fishery Coin.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Riccioli_Fishery_Coin.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/b/b1/Item_Riccioli_Fishery_Coin.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20250224162949\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 2,000</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\"><img alt=\"Shell Credit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Shell Credit.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Shell_Credit.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d1/Item_Shell_Credit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523132525\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 10,000</span></span></div></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ahab\" title=\"Ahab\">Ahab</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Phoebe\" title=\"Phoebe\">Phoebe</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Planck\" title=\"Planck\">Planck</a>, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Queequeg (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUXVlZXF1ZWc/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Queequeg</span>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rachel\" title=\"Rachel\">Rachel</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n<b>Where All Fish Converge</b> is the  act in <a href=\"/wiki/Riccioli_Voyage_Log\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Riccioli Voyage Log\">Riccioli Voyage Log</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Quest\" title=\"Main Quest\">Main Quest</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Summary\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Summary</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Summary\">Summary</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The Tidebreaker has indeed been wandering in Serene Bay. After the lighthouse was relit, the beast swam towards a small island covered in storm...\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>You have obtained the ship blueprint. Go ask Queequeg about ship repairs</li>\n<li>Deliver the required materials to continue Pequod's repairs\n<ol><li>Collect 100 Palm Logs</li>\n<li>Collect 2,000 Riccioli Fishery Coins</li>\n<li>Retrieve \"Pequod Blueprint: Basic\"</li></ol></li>\n<li>Prepare for departure at the dock and head to Serene Bay</li>\n<li>Travel to Serene Bay</li>\n<li>Defeat the Tacet Discords</li>\n<li>Locate the dock in Serene Bay and ask Planck for details</li>\n<li>Complete Planck's mission request</li>\n<li>Complete Priority Requests (0/4)\n<ol><li>Complete Priority Request \"Ahab's Request: Finding the Keyname in event \"Find the Key\"&#32;&#91;<i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/sic\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:sic\">sic</a></i>&#93;\"</li>\n<li>Complete Priority Request \"Ahab's Request: A Feather?name in event \"Feather?\"&#32;&#91;<i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/sic\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:sic\">sic</a></i>&#93;\"</li>\n<li>Complete Priority Request \"Ahab's Request: Into the Underworldname in event \"Meet the Phantom\"&#32;&#91;<i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/sic\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:sic\">sic</a></i>&#93;\"</li>\n<li>Complete Priority Request \"Ahab's Request: Setting the Trapname in event \"Rainbow Rush\"&#32;&#91;<i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/sic\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:sic\">sic</a></i>&#93;\"</li></ol></li>\n<li>Set sail and catch Titanium Mackerel at the given location</li>\n<li>Light up the lighthouse in Serene Bay</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Completing \"Search for Starbuck\" step awards <span class=\"item\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" style=\"height:30px;width:30px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%22Sweet_Puff%22\" title=\"&quot;Sweet Puff&quot;\"><img alt=\"&quot;Sweet Puff&quot;\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Item_%22Sweet_Puff%22.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20250225214335\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Item &quot;Sweet Puff&quot;.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_%22Sweet_Puff%22.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%22Sweet_Puff%22\" title=\"&quot;Sweet Puff&quot;\"><img alt=\"&quot;Sweet Puff&quot;\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Item_%22Sweet_Puff%22.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20250225214335\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Item &quot;Sweet Puff&quot;.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_%22Sweet_Puff%22.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/%22Sweet_Puff%22\" title=\"&quot;Sweet Puff&quot;\">\"Sweet Puff\"</a></span></span>.</li>\n<li>Completing \"Travel to Serene Bay\" step awards <i><a href=\"/wiki/Rover%27s_Journey_II\" title=\"Rover&#39;s Journey II\">Rover's Journey II</a></i> trophy <i><a href=\"/wiki/Tormented_Prophet\" title=\"Tormented Prophet\">Tormented Prophet</a></i>.</li>\n<li>Completing \"Set sail and catch Titanium Mackerel at the given location\" step awards <span class=\"item\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" style=\"height:30px;width:30px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Titanium_Mackerel\" title=\"Titanium Mackerel\"><img alt=\"Titanium Mackerel\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Titanium Mackerel.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Titanium_Mackerel.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/db/Item_Titanium_Mackerel.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20250313140152\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Titanium_Mackerel\" title=\"Titanium Mackerel\"><img alt=\"Titanium Mackerel\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Titanium Mackerel.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Titanium_Mackerel.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/db/Item_Titanium_Mackerel.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20250313140152\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Titanium_Mackerel\" title=\"Titanium Mackerel\">Titanium Mackerel</a></span></span> and <i><a href=\"/wiki/Wilderness_Calls\" title=\"Wilderness Calls\">Wilderness Calls</a></i> trophy <i><a href=\"/wiki/Mackerel_Gear\" title=\"Mackerel Gear\">Mackerel Gear</a></i>.</li>\n<li>Completing the quest awards <span class=\"item\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" style=\"height:30px;width:30px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pequod_Blueprint:_Advanced\" title=\"Pequod Blueprint: Advanced\"><img alt=\"Pequod Blueprint Advanced\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Pequod Blueprint.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Pequod_Blueprint.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/1c/Item_Pequod_Blueprint.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20250313141140\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pequod_Blueprint:_Advanced\" title=\"Pequod Blueprint: Advanced\"><img alt=\"Pequod Blueprint Advanced\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Pequod Blueprint.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Pequod_Blueprint.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/1c/Item_Pequod_Blueprint.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20250313141140\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Pequod_Blueprint:_Advanced\" title=\"Pequod Blueprint: Advanced\">Pequod Blueprint: Advanced</a></span></span>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dd><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-title\"><b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"UI Quest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"UI Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"UI_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0f/UI_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260501180345\" /></span></span> Quest Description</b></div><hr class=\"description-separator\" /><div class=\"description-content\">Here, all fish gather—and since whales are also considered \"fish\", then...</div></div></dd>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Approach Pequod)</dt>\n<dd><i>The once wreckage is starting look&#32;&#91;</i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/sic\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:sic\">sic</a><i>&#93; more like a ship now.</i></dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Deliver materials)</dt>\n<dd><b>Queequeg:</b> Ship almost fixed up. Thank you. Only half to go.</dd>\n<dd><b>Queequeg:</b> Captain's orders. Almost working.</dd>\n<dd><b>Queequeg:</b> As long ship is repaired, will be fine. All will be fine.</dd>\n<dd><b>Queequeg:</b> By the way, that big \"fish.\" Serene Bay.</dd>\n<dd><b>Queequeg:</b> We failed before. You be careful.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Idle)</dt>\n<dd><b>Queequeg:</b> Ship getting better. Ahab lost his harpoon.</dd>\n<dd><b>Queequeg:</b> Ahab says, once ship is repaired, we can all go home.</dd>\n<dd><b>Queequeg:</b> Ahab is captain. He is right.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>The Tidebreaker knocks over your boat, and you're washed ashore by the heavy waves...</b></dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><b>Rover:</b> Phoebe!</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Get out of the way!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Defeat the TDs)</dt>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;)! Are you hurt?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Still in one piece.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> My fish...</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> The Tidebreaker attacked us! Thank Imperator none of us were hurt.</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> Quick, let's check if anything was lost!</dd>\n<dd><b>You check your belongings...</b></dd>\n<dd><i>You find a bizarre fish, its color all wrong, and its eyes glow with an unsettling shimmer.</i></dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Nothing's lost, except now we've got this...</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> What a strange fish...</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> How about we take it back to Planck? Maybe it knows what this is.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Talk with Planck)</dt>\n<dd><b>Planck:</b> ...!</dd>\n<dd><i>The octopus Echo waves its tentacles around as it hands you a not from Ahab.</i></dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> \"Once it's safe, Planck can swim over to Seren Bay.\"</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> \"Since the lighthouse on Starbuck's island is up and running, we can set sail again. We're counting on you and Miss White Hat.\"</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> \"There'll be monsters swarming in those waters, ever since Cetus went missing.\"</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> \"Word is, the key to Serene Bay's lighthouse got lost long ago. We only know it's somewhere at the bottom of the sea.\"</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> \"Oh, I reckon you'll be greeted by a few strange fish along the way.\"</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> \"I'll keep poking around and see what else I can dig up. I'll have Planck send word once I've got news.\"</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Light up the lighthouse in Serene Bay)</dt>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;)! Look, it's the Tidebreaker!</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> They're heading towards that island to the west!</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> Their wounds seem to be healing, but I still feel the intense fury in their cries.</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_EN_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Emoji_EN_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221541\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;English</b></td><td>Where All Fish Converge</td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHS Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHS Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5f/Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221618\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Simplified\"><small>(S)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">万鱼归一</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHT Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHT Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHT_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/02/Emoji_ZHT_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221733\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Traditional\"><small>(T)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">萬魚歸一</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji JA Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji JA Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_JA_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/8/84/Emoji_JA_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221804\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">すべての魚が一匹に</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji KO Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji KO Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_KO_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5d/Emoji_KO_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221837\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">모든</span> <span lang=\"ko\">물고기가</span> <span lang=\"ko\">모이는</span> <span lang=\"ko\">곳</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji FR Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji FR Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_FR_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/c/c6/Emoji_FR_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221935\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;French</b></td><td>Là où les poissons se rassemblent</td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji DE Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji DE Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_DE_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/3/3b/Emoji_DE_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221959\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;German</b></td><td>Wo alle Fische zusammenkommen</td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ES Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ES Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ES_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d2/Emoji_ES_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221908\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Spanish</b></td><td>Donde todos los peces convergen</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/2.1\" title=\"Version/2.1\">Version 2.1</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/Where_All_Fish_Converge/Change_History?ac